        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The key competitive factors affecting the success of PYRUKYND®, AQVESME™ and any of our product candidates that we develop, if approved, are likely to be their efficacy, safety, convenience, price, the level of generic competition and the availability of reimbursement from government and other third-party payors.",
